<HTML>
<BODY BGCOLOR="#000000" TEXT="#FFFFFF" LINK="#90FFFF" VLINK="#CCCCCC">
<FONT FACE="Arial,Helvetica">

<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">

<!--//

   if (document.images) {

      // Load images needed [BACK] button.

      back_on  = new Image(); back_on.src  = "../../buttons/back_on.gif";  
      back_off = new Image(); back_off.src = "../../buttons/back.gif";  
   }

   function TurnOn() {

      // Displays image and updates status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_on.src;
         window.status = 'Go back to previous page';
      }
   }

   function TurnOff() {

      // Displays image and clears status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_off.src;
         window.status = '';
      }
   }

//-->

</SCRIPT>
<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:christian_anita@freenet.de">Christian Reichelt</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

        Christian (22 yrs old) and his partner Anita (19 yrs old) live near Berlin and
	spend a lot of time driving and washing the car.
	<P>
	They bought the car in August 2000 and love to drive it. They will do anything
	to keep it in good condition. Just before Christmas 2000 their 16V suffered
	engine damage. However they have two Tipo 16V cars. The other they bought in
	October 2000 just in case anything happened to the other.
	<P>
	They have to register the car in order to drive it (I guess a bit like the UK
	road tax) which costs a lot of money in Germany. However they say they
	would register this car a thousand times.

